# Switch 开关

**Category**: react
**URL**: https://wangjinyang.github.io/heroui-v3-docs-public/cn/docs/react/components/switch
**Source**: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/heroui-inc/heroui/refs/heads/v3/apps/docs/content/docs/cn/react/components/(controls)/switch.mdx
> 用于布尔状态的开关组件。


## 引入

```tsx
import { Switch, SwitchGroup, Label } from '@heroui/react';

```

### 用法

```tsx
import {Label, Switch} from "@heroui/react";

export function Basic() {
  return (
    <Switch>
      <Switch.Control>
        <Switch.Thumb />
      </Switch.Control>
      <Switch.Content>
        <Label className="text-sm">启用通知</Label>
      </Switch.Content>
    </Switch>
  );
}

```

### 组件结构

引入 Switch 组件，并通过点语法访问各部分。

```tsx
import { Switch, Label, Description } from '@heroui/react';

export default () => (
  <Switch>
    <Switch.Control>
      <Switch.Thumb>
        <Switch.Icon/> {/* Optional */}
      </Switch.Thumb>
    </Switch.Control>
    <Switch.Content>
      <Label />
      <Description /> {/* Optional */}
    </Switch.Content>
  </Switch>
);

```

要对多个 Switch 进行分组，请使用 `SwitchGroup` 组件：

```tsx
import { Switch, SwitchGroup, Label } from '@heroui/react';

export default () => (
  <SwitchGroup>
    <Switch>
      <Switch.Control>
        <Switch.Thumb />
      </Switch.Control>
      <Label>Option 1</Label>
    </Switch>
    <Switch>
      <Switch.Control>
        <Switch.Thumb />
      </Switch.Control>
      <Label>Option 2</Label>
    </Switch>
  </SwitchGroup>
);

```

